⚠️ Common Issues and Fixes
Issue	Symptom	Fix
Container not running	docker ps shows nothing	docker start nautilus
Wrong volume mapping	docker inspect shows different paths	Recreate container with -v /var/www/html:/usr/local/apache2/htdocs
Wrong port mapping	docker port shows different port	Recreate container with -p 8085:80
Empty website content	curl returns empty or 403	Check /var/www/html has content on host
Firewall blocking	Connection refused from external	Open port: firewall-cmd --add-port=8085/tcp --permanent && firewall-cmd --reload
